{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorPaths\/isSelfContained()"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if the editor is marked as self-contained, "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" otherwise. When self-contained mode is enabled, user configuration, data and cache files are saved in an "},{"code":"editor_data\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" folder next to the editor binary. This makes portable usage easier and ensures the Godot editor minimizes file writes outside its own folder. Self-contained mode is not available for exported projects."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSelfContained","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"isSelfContained()","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10SwiftGodot11EditorPathsC15isSelfContainedSbyF","modules":[{"name":"SwiftGodot"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/editorpaths\/isselfcontained()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot","doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/EditorPaths"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSelfContained","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineConte